OL,3,GNEWSAParkrun back after suspension over
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parkrun event has returned three
OL,7,Fweeks after being suspended due to a
OL,8,Fsurge in attendance and safety concerns
OL,9,Fover runners overtaking.
OL,11,FWeymouth parkrun, held at Lodmoor
OL,12,FCountry Park, had been attracting more
OL,13,Fthan 500 participants each week before
OL,14,Fbeing temporarily cancelled in August.
OL,16,FOrganisers said the decision had been
OL,17,Fmade after a rise in numbers and, "more
OL,18,Fworryingly", an increase in reports of
OL,19,Frunners overtaking in confined areas.
