OL,3,GNEWSAParkrun back after suspension over
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing its suspension, 379 runners
OL,7,Freturned to Lodmoor Country Park on
OL,8,FSaturday to complete the the 5km
OL,9,F(3.1-mile) route on Saturday after a
OL,10,Ftwo-week hiatus.
